{"segs": ["PA_ja_147:0.4", "PA_ja_147:1.1"], "en": "7. The Puṣparatta Jātaka “This is no suffering, nor is that suffering,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_147:1.2"], "en": "Which the crow torments me.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_147:1.3"], "en": "“Because of her attachment to flowers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_147:1.4"], "en": "Sāmā shall not enjoy the Kattika festival.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_147:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the seventh Jātaka, the Puppharatta-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
